-- APPROACH (mirrors the committed p4-apple feature-view methodology) --
The web page is ported natively to SwiftUI as a multi-file surface under
apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Battery/, following the gold-standard pattern of the
1266 existing feature-view files: a pure, Shared-free projection core (own SI +
number formatting ported from lib/numberFormat.ts + lib/unitConversion.ts), an
@Observable model bound through a state-holder seam (P1/S8), SwiftUI views built from
the P2 design tokens + P3 shared components, and a per-page i18n facade resolving the
56 manifest keys from the platform string catalog (Localizable.xcstrings).

Files added (apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Battery/, 12):
  EnergyPage.swift             — EnergyPage: View (scaffold, header, phase switch, i18n bridge, tint map)
  EnergyPage.Model.swift       — EnergyPageInput/Resolved/Projection, seam, @Observable EnergyPageModel, EnergyStrings
  EnergyPage.Adapter.swift     — EnergyConnection, EnergyConvert, EnergyFormat, EnergyUnits, inputs, EnergyChargerKind, EnergyTint
  EnergyPage.Models.swift      — EnergyDerived + the resolved sub-models + EnergyPageData
  EnergyPage.Builders.swift    — EnergyBuilders: gauges/quickMetrics/lifetime/costCards
  EnergyPage.Builders.Series.swift — EnergyBuilders: daily/timeOfDay/chargerBreakdown/sessions
  EnergyPage.Views.swift       — freshness chrome, GlassPanel1 hero gauges, GlassPanel2 strip, section header, inline empty, skeleton
  EnergyPage.Panels.swift      — GlassPanel3 lifetime, GlassPanel4 cost cards, GlassPanel9 sessions table
  EnergyPage.Charts.swift      — 4 chart panels (TSChartContainer + native Swift Charts)
  EnergyPage.Routing.swift     — EnergyRouteRegistration (.energy) + EnergyPagePendingSource
  EnergyPage.Previews.swift    — sample data + 4 state previews
  EnergyPage.Tests.swift       — 30 XCTest cases (formatting/convert/builders/projection/model)

Navigation registration (allowed): Sources/TeslaSyncApp.swift chains
  EnergyRouteRegistration.registry(base: SettingsRouteRegistration.registry(...)).
Build wiring: project.yml adds `- path: TeslaSync/Features` to both app targets;
  .swiftlint.yml adds TeslaSync/Features to `included`.
Strings: Localization/Localizable.xcstrings += 68 keys (56 manifest + 12 native-chrome),
  purely additive (748 insertions / 0 deletions; JSON validated).

